{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Fully detach enums and map keys**\n\nThe copy still shares enum instances and every map key. A custom exporter can mutate a stateful enum or mutable key and thereby alter cached content or later exporters' records, violating the isolation guarantee. Normalize enums to JSON scalars and rebuild keys using the mapper's key-serialization semantics; add mutable-enum and mutable-key tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv5TO","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":66,"observation_digest":"2308ec2ff4bb754b45abda47384194e1be2bad76698f9ae28d01f3e8f53e2a1e","observation_id":"aro_v1_emeoyl7uxn2uwrnl3jdtqqmu4g","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:21Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":60,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_btucgsoyxbvczrlgpfxc2n7pjc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:21Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
